     * @param suffix
     *            file extension; include the '.'.
     * @param parentDir
     *            Directory to create the temporary file in; java.io.tmpdir used
     *            if not specified.
     *
     * @deprecated since ant 1.7.1 use createTempFile(String, String, File,
     * boolean, boolean) instead.
